392
00:21:02.680 --> 00:21:04.800
I think this is the one that you probably thought about.

393
00:21:04.800 --> 00:21:05.840
Context bloat.

394
00:21:05.840 --> 00:21:10.480
I've seen some skills where I've had to cut down a thousand lines just because —

395
00:21:10.520 --> 00:21:12.640
super duplicative.

396
00:21:13.720 --> 00:21:14.040
Yeah.

397
00:21:14.040 --> 00:21:16.120
One last thing.

398
00:21:16.120 --> 00:21:18.040
Agent skills are for agents.

399
00:21:18.040 --> 00:21:21.440
I feel like sometimes I've seen — especially in the open source world —

400
00:21:21.440 --> 00:21:26.120
where it was clearly written by a human for a human, but that's the wrong audience.

401
00:21:26.160 --> 00:21:28.920
Like trying to explain what a REST API is or whatnot —

402
00:21:28.920 --> 00:21:31.240
it's just wasted tokens.

403
00:21:31.240 --> 00:21:34.240
And the last one is —

