00:22:13.600 --> 00:22:16.600
down to the third and last part of the talk, which is:

418
00:22:16.600 --> 00:22:20.760
how do you actually enable your team to develop context and upskill?

419
00:22:20.760 --> 00:22:25.200
Now I think there are three main approaches.

420
00:22:25.360 --> 00:22:28.080
Just taking a pulse here.

