00:23:56.000 --> 00:23:59.600
then each task should be very easy to put as a skill.

449
00:24:01.080 --> 00:24:02.520
Yes, that's right.

450
00:24:02.520 --> 00:24:04.840
Yeah. Absolutely.

451
00:24:04.840 --> 00:24:05.880
No, no, no — absolutely not.

452
00:24:05.880 --> 00:24:09.080
The only thing I would add to that is: how

453
00:24:09.080 --> 00:24:12.640
