454
00:24:12.640 --> 00:24:16.680
And that's the part where I would say, okay, well, even if it's the human —

455
00:24:16.680 --> 00:24:17.880
you can try.

456
00:24:17.880 --> 00:24:20.240
Yeah. You just make sure to evaluate it.

457
00:24:20.240 --> 00:24:23.240
So it goes back to that context development lifecycle —

458
00:24:23.280 --> 00:24:29.040
like, something that we've done in this outreach where I help

459
00:24:29.120 --> 00:24:32.680
